  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gambia - Preparation of Technical Studies to enhance the Gambia&#x2019;s Strategic Programme for Climate Resilience (SPCR)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Gambie - Pr&#xe9;paration d&apos;&#xe9;tudes techniques pour renforcer le programme strat&#xe9;gique de r&#xe9;silience climatique de la Gambie (SPCR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to help the Government of the Gambia to develop a strategic investment program for the Gambia. Furthermore, the initiative supports the Government&#x2019;s effort to integrate climate change into policy planning and implementation, build resilience in the coastal zone and climate proof vital infrastructure.The project has made progress toward achieving expected outputs in all its components. Progress towards achieving this objective is therefore very satisfactory. The last year of the project witnessed an accelerated rate of implementation of the Components due to the successful replenishment of the Special Account.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
